OL,3,GNEWSAThe Ghostbuster-esque team on a
OL,4,Achewing gum mission
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere's something strange in the
OL,7,Fneighbourhood.
OL,9,FIt is not, however, a Ghostbuster,
OL,10,Fdespite the resemblance to the
OL,11,Fjumpsuit-wearing New York team of 1980s
OL,12,Fparanormal exterminators.
OL,14,FIt is a North Yorkshire Council (NYC)
OL,15,Foperative called Tristan, working in
OL,16,FSelby as part of the Chewing Gum Task
OL,17,FForce.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
