OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme, managed by charity Keep
OL,7,FBritain Tidy and funded by the
OL,8,Fgovernment and chewing gum
OL,9,Fmanufacturers, involves grant funding
OL,10,Fbeing given to local authorities.
